==Description==

[[File:PartDesign_MoveFeature.svg|24px]] [[PartDesign_MoveFeature|Move Object To…]], as this command is labeled in the context menu, allows moving objects under a Body to another Body. The moved object is placed right below the other Body's tip. Sketches, datum geometry and features are supported.

==Usage==

# In the [[Tree_View|Tree View]], right-click the object to be moved.
# Select the {{MenuCommand|[[File:PartDesign_MoveFeature.svg|16px]] Move Object To…}} option from the context menu.
# In the '''Select Body''' dialog, select the Body to move the object to from the drop-down menu.
# Press {{Button|OK}}.


